# Sample graph for the treasury `tx-count` named query.
#
# Three cardano:Transaction nodes plus a non-transaction Output node
# that must NOT be counted. The query projects COUNT(DISTINCT ?tx).
@prefix cardano: <https://lambdasistemi.github.io/cardano-ledger-rdf/vocab/cardano#> .

<urn:tx:aaaa> a cardano:Transaction .
<urn:tx:bbbb> a cardano:Transaction .
<urn:tx:cccc> a cardano:Transaction .
<urn:out:1>   a cardano:Output .
